    "title": "Album Review: Chat Pile and Hayden Pedigo - In the Earth Again - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Darren Petrosino ,\n13 hours ago With all of its ghost towns, a depressing acreage of Oklahoma has been forsaken into the past tense. For every Tulsa that is, there’s a Beer City that was. Having no packages to mail there anymore romanticizes these ghost towns as debaucherous-sounding places to have been. Only when the post office of former oil boom town Denoya gets shuttered can it be properly remembered by its honorable People’s Name of Whizbang. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
